.TH MOCK-SBOM-GENERATOR 1 "September 2026" "mock-sbom-generator 2.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
mock-sbom-generator \- generate CycloneDX or SPDX SBOMs from Mock build artifacts
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mock-sbom-generator
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Generate a Software Bill of Materials from a Mock result directory.
The same tool is invoked by the
.B sbom_generator
Mock plugin after a successful build.
.PP
Default output is CycloneDX 1.6 JSON named
.I <name>-<version>-<release>.sbom
plus a
.I .sha256
sidecar. SPDX 2.3 JSON is written as
.I <name>-<version>-<release>.spdx.json
when
.B --type spdx
is given.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --type {cyclonedx,spdx}
Document format (default: cyclonedx).
.TP
.BI --resultdir " DIR"
Directory containing built RPMs/SRPMs (required).
.TP
.BI --root " DIR"
Mock build chroot root. Required for toolchain and chroot RPM queries.
Omitting it skips those collectors.
.B --root /
is rejected.
.TP
.BI --builddir " PATH"
Chroot-relative build directory (default:
.IR /builddir/build ).
.TP
.BI --prebuild-json " FILE"
Optional forensic snapshot written by the plugin before the build.
.TP
.B --include-file-components true|false
.TP
.B --include-file-dependencies true|false
.TP
.B --include-debug-files true|false
.TP
.B --include-man-pages true|false
.TP
.B --include-source-dependencies true|false
.TP
.B --include-toolchain-dependencies true|false
.TP
.B --generate-cpe true|false
Emit heuristic CPE identifiers (default: false).
.TP
.B -v , --verbose
Debug logging.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /usr/lib*/python*/site-packages/mockbuild/plugins/sbom_generator.py
Mock plugin (enable with
.BR "mock --enable-plugin=sbom_generator" ).
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR mock (1)
.SH AUTHOR
Scott R. Shinn, Atomicorp, Inc.
